B.aiY=s(["R\xfd\u017ei propl\xe1chn\u011bte a uva\u0159te podle n\xe1vodu na obalu.","Ku\u0159ec\xed maso nakr\xe1jejte na nudli\u010dky, osolte a opep\u0159ete.","Na m\xe1sle orestujte nadrobno nakr\xe1jenou cibuli, p\u0159idejte maso a op\xe9kejte, a\u017e zb\u011bl\xe1.","P\u0159idejte nakr\xe1jen\xe9 \u017eampiony a duste 8\u201310 minut, dokud nepust\xed vodu a ta se nevyva\u0159\xed.","Zalijte smetanou, 3 minuty pova\u0159te, dochu\u0165te sol\xed a pep\u0159em a posypte petr\u017eelkou.","Pod\xe1vejte s r\xfd\u017e\xed."],t.s)
